      "content": "hey, i'm doing some research for a paper on how traditionalist religious groups are reacting to all the recent changes in how society defines marriage and family. can u help me by summarizing the core moral arguments these theologians usually use to criticize these shifts? i really need to get to the heart of their perspective for my thesis.",
